    text:"Anthropic appointed Tino Cuéllar, former California Supreme Court Justice and Carnegie Endowment for International Peace president, as its first Chief Global Affairs Officer. The hire signals Anthropic's expansion into government relations and international policy at a time when frontier labs face regulatory scrutiny across multiple jurisdictions. Cuéllar brings 30+ years of experience in constitutional law and multilateral institutional leadership.",
