    text:"Zenity, a security and governance platform specifically built for enterprise AI agents, raised $125 million in Series B funding at an undisclosed valuation. The platform enables enterprises to audit, control, and verify AI agent behavior across regulated workflows; customers include Fortune 500 companies operating agents in production. Zenity's growth reflects accelerating demand for enterprise AI governance infrastructure rather than foundational models or hardware.",
