    text:"IBM and OpenAI announced a strategic partnership to help enterprises deploy AI across core operations, legacy systems, software development, and cybersecurity. The collaboration combines IBM's enterprise consulting expertise and longstanding relationships with Fortune 500 customers with OpenAI's frontier models and agentic capabilities. Initial focus areas include AI-assisted software development, security incident response, and infrastructure modernization—targeting regulated industries where IBM's compliance track record matters.",
